B.bXt=new A.f0("seerah-01","The Year of the Elephant","The hour of birth, and the army that could not enter Makkah.")
B.bXR=new A.f0("seerah-02","The Orphan of Makkah","Father gone before birth, mother at six, grandfather at eight \u2014 and yet al-Amin, the trustworthy.")
B.bXP=new A.f0("seerah-03","Al-Amin, The Trustworthy","The title Makkah gave him before revelation \u2014 character precedes the call.")
B.bXE=new A.f0("seerah-04","The Cave of Hira","Forty years old, seeking quiet \u2014 and the first word is Iqra.")
B.bXJ=new A.f0("seerah-31","Iqra \u2014 The First Word","Read, in the name of your Lord. The first revelation chose knowledge.")
B.bXs=new A.f0("seerah-05","Three Years of Whispers","Secret teaching, then open call \u2014 patience measured in years.")
B.bXu=new A.f0("seerah-06","Bilal and the Heavy Sand","One word \u2014 Ahad \u2014 heavier than the mountain of sand on his chest.")
B.bXI=new A.f0("seerah-07","The Night of the Journey","From the Haram to Jerusalem to the seven heavens in one night.")
B.bXw=new A.f0("seerah-08","The Boycott","Three years of siege in the valley \u2014 and the believers stayed.")
B.bXN=new A.f0("seerah-09","The First Hijrah","To Abyssinia, where a just king protected the weak \u2014 Musab carried the message.")
B.bXx=new A.f0("seerah-10","The Conversion of Umar","The man who came to kill left proclaiming \u2014 strength that found its direction.")
B.bXF=new A.f0("seerah-11","Taif","Driven to a vineyard outside the city, he prayed to Allah in his weakness and hoped for their descendants.")
B.bXy=new A.f0("seerah-12","The Pledges of Aqabah","The people of Yathrib reach for the Prophet \u2014 a city will be renamed after him.")
